      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5409008750893734809\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F86.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🏆\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e \u003cb\u003eTelegram\u003c/b\u003e is launching a \u003cb\u003e$200,000 contest\u003c/b\u003e for content creators.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5375464961822695044\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8EAC.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🎬\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Create a video about \u003cb\u003edigital freedom\u003c/b\u003e using ideas and footage from \u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Yq_5aDdJ24\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003ethis speech\u003c/a\u003e — plus any content or ideas of your own.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5244837092042750681\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9388.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e📈\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Pass \u003cb\u003e10,000+\u003c/b\u003e organic views for a chance to win a share of the prize fund.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5469903029144657419\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F93A3.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e📣\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://t.me/contest/456\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003eFull details\u003c/a\u003e in the \u003ca href=\"https://t.me/contest\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e@contest\u003c/a\u003e channel.",
      "date": "2026-06-15T15:53:15Z",
